OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain may be heavy at times in
OL,6,Fthe morning as it clears to the south.
OL,7,FIncreasingly bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping during the afternoon with
OL,9,Fthe odd shower possible. Mostly light
OL,10,Fwinds, breezier near the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly cloudy through the
OL,13,Fevening and overnight with some clear
OL,14,Fintervals and showers, some of which
OL,15,Fwill be heavy. Breezy near coasts in
OL,16,Fthe evening then winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
