OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,6,Fthe day with scattered showers in the
OL,7,Fmorning, which may be heavy. Showers
OL,8,Feasing through the afternoon leading
OL,9,Fto largely dry conditions in the
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,13,Fdry and settled over the next few days
OL,14,Fwith cloud at times but some long
OL,15,Fspells of sunshine on offer. Chillier
OL,16,Fnights than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
